#: page-about.php:55
msgid ""
"Langgam Fikir is an independent publishing house dedicated to bringing "
"profound narratives and critical thought to the forefront of the Malaysian "
"literary scene."
msgstr ""

#: page-about.php:59
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Misi Kami"

#: page-about.php:64
msgid ""
"Founded in 2015, we operate with a singular vision: to publish books that "
"matter. In an age of fleeting digital content, we believe in the enduring "
"power of the physical book as a technology for preserving deep thought."
msgstr ""

#: page-about.php:66
msgid ""
"We focus on translating key works of global philosophy and literature into "
"Malay, while also nurturing local voices that speak with clarity and courage "
"on contemporary issues."
msgstr ""

#: page-about.php:75
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Terjemahan"

#: page-about.php:76
msgid ""
"Bridging cultures by bringing world classics to local readers with high-"
"fidelity translations."
msgstr ""

#: page-about.php:79
msgid "Original Works"
msgstr "Karya Asli"

#: page-about.php:80
msgid ""
"Providing a platform for Malaysian thinkers, poets, and storytellers to "
"document our times."
msgstr ""

